{"candidates":[],"candidates_truncated":false,"canonical_status":"canonical","citations":[],"contract_version":"2","descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:82326","original":"[b]Altria Pendragon[/b] (also known by the popular fan romanization as [b]Artoria Pendragon[/b]) is a character from the [[Fate (series)|]] series, and the [i]de facto[/i] mascot of the series.\r\n\r\nShe is a [[genderswap (mtf)|]]ped version of [[King Arthur (mythology)|]] from the old English mythology, manifested as a \"Servant\", powerful manifestation of historical/mythological figures in the Fate universe.\r\n\r\nShe first appeared in [[Fate/Stay Night]] as [[Saber (fate)|]], but later went on to appear in many other forms throughout the [[Fate (series)|]] series. This tag is an umbrella tag that collects all versions of Artoria Pendragon under one tag.\r\n\r\nShe and her variants, with the exception of Arthur Pendragon, are voiced by [[Kawasumi Ayako]].\r\n\r\nh4. Variants\r\n\r\nh6. Youth\r\n* !post #2647501: [[Saber (fate)|]][br][[Fate/Stay Night]]\r\n* !asset #25326288: [[Saber Alter]][br][[Heaven's Feel]]\r\n* !post #8649891: [[Saber Lily]][br][[Fate/Unlimited Codes]]\r\n* !asset #33520635: [[Saber Lion]][br][[Fate/Tiger Colosseum]]\r\n* !post #1161284: [[Master Artoria]][br][[Capsule Servant]]\r\n* !post #4044400: [[Artoria Caster (fate)|]][br][[Fate/Grand Order]]\r\n* !asset #38775491: [[Lord Logres (fate)|]][br][[Fate/Grand Order]]\r\n* !post #74415: [[Sader]][br]Infamous bootleg figure\r\n\r\nh6. Servant Universe\r\n* !asset #22760141: [[Mysterious Heroine X (fate)|]][br][[Rojiura Satsuki: Chapter Heroine Sanctuary|Rojiura Satsuki]]\r\n* !asset #22760508: [[Mysterious Heroine X Alter (Fate)|]][br][[Fate/Grand Order]]\r\n* !asset #22759417: [[Mysterious Heroine XX (fate)|]][br][[Fate/Grand Order]]\r\n* !post #8746535: [[Mysterious Heroine XX Alter (Fate)|]][br][[Fate/Grand Order]]\r\n\r\nh6. Mature Adult\r\n* !post #2383941: [[Artoria Pendragon (Lancer Alter) (Fate)|Lancer Alter]][br][[Fate/Grand Order]]\r\n* !asset #25345731: [[Artoria Pendragon (Lancer) (Fate)|Lancer]][br][[Fate/Grand Order]]\r\n* !asset #25345817: [[Artoria Pendragon (Swimsuit Ruler) (Fate)|Swimsuit Ruler]][br][[Fate/Grand Order]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\nDespite their names and very similar appearances, these characters are considered to be separate characters from Artoria Pendragon:\r\n\r\n* [[Nero Claudius (Fate)|]] (Saber Extra / Red Saber)\r\n* [[Mordred (Fate)|]] (Saber of Red)\r\n* [[Okita Souji (Fate)|]] (Sakura Saber)\r\n\r\nMale versions of Artoria Pendragon:\r\n\r\n* [[Arthur Pendragon (Fate)|]] - Male Saber from [[Fate/Prototype]].\r\n* [[Saver (fate/prototype)|]] - Original character design as a male.","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","title":"artoria_pendragon_(fate)"}],"evidence_chain":[{"evidence_id":"native:1478495","fetched_at_utc":"2026-09-30T06:43:34.899059+00:00","raw_path":"reports/P3/raw/4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668a7b8.raw","raw_sha256":"4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668a7b8","role":"native_identity","source_id":"danbooru-native-scoped-4ccce02e466f","tag_id":1478495},{"active_alias_ids":[],"coverage":"scoped_complete","evidence_id":"scope:artoria_pendragon_(fate)","fetched_at_utc":"2026-09-30T06:44:03.861433+00:00","name":"artoria_pendragon_(fate)","raw_path":"reports/P3/raw/4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945.raw","raw_sha256":"4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","role":"canonical_scope","source_id":"danbooru-native-scoped-4ccce02e466f"},{"association":"official embedded tag.wiki_page","evidence_id":"wiki:88644","fetched_at_utc":"2026-09-30T06:43:34.899059+00:00","raw_path":"reports/P3/raw/4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668a7